# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — FIXORA 2.0
## AI-Assisted Data Reliability, Investigation & Repair Platform

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI product architect, data engineer, UI/UX designer, and QA engineer. Build a complete, polished, functional, production-minded web application named **Fixora**.

**Tagline:** Fix the noise. Find the truth.

**Product vision:** Fixora is an evidence-driven data reliability platform that detects data quality issues, investigates their root causes, compares alternative repair strategies, predicts potential downstream effects, validates new dataset versions, and maintains a transparent audit trail.

This must be a genuinely dynamic full-stack application. Do not build a static landing page, a frontend-only prototype, or a dashboard full of hardcoded numbers. All essential features must work end to end with real uploaded datasets.

